abstract: >
  Open Polityra is an independent, international, open-source research and
  strategic intelligence platform. It brings together researchers, developers,
  economists, analysts, and contributors to study global economics, geopolitics,
  security, cybersecurity, resilience, energy, governance, and long-term global
  developments.
keywords:
  - strategic-intelligence
  - geopolitics
  - economics
